# Teferi's Protection: "Until your next turn, your life total can't change and you gain protection from everything."
# Bot1 (at 10 life) casts it in its turn 3 first main phase, then plays Flooded Strand and casts Lightning Helix at Bot2: Bot2 takes 3,
# but Bot1 gains no life (CR 119.7, 119.8), and Bot1 can't pay the Strand's 1 life (the ruling: "You can't pay a cost that
# includes the payment of any amount of life other than 0 life"). On turn 4 Bot2's Sunspine Lynx deals Bot1 1 damage for the
# Strand, which can't be prevented, so protection does not stop it - but Bot1's life total still doesn't change (the ruling on
# damage that can't be prevented). Bot2 can't target Bot1 with Lightning Bolt (CR 702.16b, 702.16j). As Bot1's turn 5 begins
# both effects end (CR 611.2b): Bot1 pays the Strand's life, and on turn 6 Bot2's Bolt reaches Bot1 - the positive controls.

